    comment "en" """
        Source T861W = SNOMED CT 58797008. This is a residual bucket for specified causes not elsewhere
        classified. SNOMED CT 199991 (Disorder of transplanted kidney, concept_code 58797008) is the Athena
        crosswalk target for parent T86.1 and is the legitimate ancestor of all kidney-transplant
        disorders. Target subsumes the source; broader. Moderate because the source is a heterogeneous
        residual.
        """
}
