mapping "T863A.1" source="T863A" target="312603000" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.87 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source T863A (Swedish extension of T86.3) = SNOMED CT 312603000 — lung transplant acute
        biopsy-verified rejection. Note: WHO T86.3 denotes heart-LUNG transplant failure/rejection, but
        the Swedish extension narrows this to lung-only transplant. The WHO crosswalk target SNOMED CT
        213152006 (Heart-lung transplant failure and rejection) is semantically wrong for the Swedish
        lung-only meaning. Best lung-specific standard concept is (Lung transplant rejection), which
        subsumes acute biopsy-verified rejection. Broader, one level. Confidence : lung-specific
        standard concept, clearly correct, with a small breadth mismatch on acuity/verification detail.
        Source meaning (lung-only) verified against the Swedish concept name; crosswalk overridden
        because the WHO T86.3 scope differs from the Swedish extension.
        """
}
